			<<His>> <<if $pillory.tenant.person.gender is "m" and $pillory.tenant.person.strapon is undefined>>penis<<else>>pussy<</if>> has been raped raw.
		<<elseif $pillory.tenant.genital gte 1>>
			<<He>> has been raped.
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $pillory.tenant.lowerexposed gte 1>>
